# Orthodox Metrics platform — deliberately written, NOT copied from
# /var/www/orthodoxmetrics/prod/.gitignore.
#
# That file bans media by extension repo-wide (`*.png`, `*.jpg`, `*.jpeg`) and then
# re-admits individual paths one negation rule at a time. Every new image location
# needs another rule, its own comments record a production build failing with
# "Could not resolve ./assets/...png" because of it, and it is why the Minimal
# template could not live in that repo.
#
# Policy here: images are source and are tracked. Things are excluded because they
# are BUILD OUTPUT, SECRETS, or NOT SOURCE — never because of their file extension.
# Large binaries stay out by placement (asset library), not by pattern.

# ---------- dependencies ----------
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/sdks
!.yarn/versions

# ---------- build output ----------
dist/
dist-*/
build/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------- caches ----------
.vite/
.cache/
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# ---------- secrets ----------
# `.env.example` and `.env.production` (which holds only non-secret build flags)
# are tracked deliberately.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
!*.pub

# ---------- logs / runtime ----------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
pids/
*.pid
*.seed

# ---------- editor / OS ----------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json

# ---------- explicitly NOT ignored, for the avoidance of doubt ----------
# Media is source. Do not add extension-based media rules here.
!**/*.png
!**/*.jpg
!**/*.jpeg
!**/*.webp
!**/*.svg
!**/*.ico
!**/*.woff
!**/*.woff2

# Agent session worklogs (workspace artifacts, not app code)
.om-worklog/
